{% extends "store-page.njk" %}

{% block content %}
  <div class="page-label">4DA Merch</div>
  <h1>Size Chart</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">Every piece is a <strong>unisex classic fit</strong> on premium Gildan blanks. Measurements are taken laid flat, so width is half the chest circumference. Sizing runs S through 5XL.</p>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>How to measure:</strong> Lay a t-shirt you already own flat and measure it. <strong>Width</strong> is armpit-to-armpit across the chest. <strong>Length</strong> is the highest point of the shoulder straight down to the hem. Match those numbers to the tables below. Between sizes? Size up for a relaxed fit. Tolerance is approximately &plusmn;1 inch (2.5 cm).
  </div>

  <div class="unit-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Units">
    <button class="unit-btn active" data-unit="in">Inches</button>
    <button class="unit-btn" data-unit="cm">Centimeters</button>
  </div>

